@startuml sequence_diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title AccessFlow — Сквозной интеграционный сценарий (UML Sequence)

box "Пользователи" #LightYellow
actor "Сотрудник" as Emp
actor "Руководитель" as Mgr
actor "Офицер ИБ" as Sec
end box

box "Система AccessFlow" #LightCyan
participant "API Gateway /\nFastAPI App" as API
participant "RequestService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
end box

box "Внешние корпоративные системы" #Lavender
participant "HRIS API" as HRIS
participant "IAM System" as IAM
end box

== 1. Подача заявки ==
Emp -> API: POST /api/v1/requests (role_id, justification)
activate API
API -> Service: create_request(data, user_id)
activate Service
Service -> HRIS: GET /api/v1/employees/{emp_id}
activate HRIS
HRIS --> Service: 200 OK (status: "ACTIVE", manager_id: "mgr-101")
deactivate HRIS

Service -> DB: Check existing active requests/roles
DB --> Service: OK (no conflict)

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO requests (status='PENDING_MANAGER', is_privileged=true)
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='CREATE_REQUEST')
DB --> Service: request_id: 123
Service --> API: RequestResponse(status='PENDING_MANAGER')
API --> Emp: 201 Created (id: 123, status: "PENDING_MANAGER")
deactivate Service
deactivate API

== 2. Согласование руководителем ==
Mgr -> API: POST /api/v1/requests/123/approve (decision='APPROVED')
activate API
API -> Service: process_approval(123, mgr_id, 'APPROVED')
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='PENDING_SECURITY'
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO approvals (step='MANAGER', status='APPROVED')
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='MANAGER_APPROVED')
DB --> Service: OK
Service --> API: 200 OK
API --> Mgr: 200 OK (Status: PENDING_SECURITY)
deactivate Service
deactivate API

== 3. Согласование ИБ (Привилегированный доступ) ==
Sec -> API: POST /api/v1/requests/123/approve (decision='APPROVED')
activate API
API -> Service: process_approval(123, sec_id, 'APPROVED')
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='APPROVED'
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO approvals (step='SECURITY', status='APPROVED')
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='SECURITY_APPROVED')
DB --> Service: OK

== 4. Автоматический провижининг в IAM ==
Service -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='IN_PROVISIONING'
Service -> IAM: POST /api/v1/provisioning\nHeader: Idempotency-Key: {req_uuid}\nBody: {emp_id, system_code, role_code}
activate IAM

alt Успешное исполнение (HTTP 200/201)
    IAM --> Service: 201 Created (provisioning_id: "iam-999")
    Service -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='PROVISIONED'
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='PROVISION_SUCCESS')
else Ошибка сервиса / Retry
    IAM --> Service: 503 Service Unavailable
    Service -> Service: Retry with Exponential Backoff (3 attempts)
    alt Все попытки исчерпаны
        Service -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='FAILED'
        Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action='PROVISION_FAILED')
    end
end
deactivate IAM

Service --> API: Final Status
API --> Sec: 200 OK (Status: PROVISIONED)
deactivate Service
deactivate API

@enduml
